    docs: document 6 process-read DUCKBRAIN env vars (DOC-13)
    
    Add DUCKBRAIN_DATA_DIR, DUCKBRAIN_UI_DIST_DIR, DUCKBRAIN_S3_ACCESS_KEY_ID,
    DUCKBRAIN_S3_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY, DUCKBRAIN_GIT_AUTHOR_NAME, and
    DUCKBRAIN_GIT_AUTHOR_EMAIL to the configuration reference with source
    locations, defaults, and precedence rules.
    
    Closes DOC-13.
    
    Co-authored-by: Alexis Okuwa <wojonstech@gmail.com>
